ond of veal.","sourceText":"Add the marsala wine and blond of veal.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":3,"text":"Add the thyme, bay leaf, peppercorns, clove, and mushroom. Cook until reduced by half.","sourceText":"Add the thyme, bay leaf, peppercorns, clove, and mushroom. Cook until reduced by half.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":4,"text":"In another saucepan heat the Espagnole sauce, tomato sauce, and game stock or essence. Cook until reduced by a third.","sourceText":"In another saucepan heat the Espagnole sauce, tomato sauce, and game stock or essence. Cook until reduced by a third.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":5,"text":"Add the contents of the first saucepan, boil the sauce a few minutes, and pass it through a sieve.","sourceText":"Add the contents of the first saucepan, boil the sauce a few minutes, and pass it through a sieve.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":6,"text":"Warm it up in a bain-marie before using.","sourceText":"Warm it up in a bain-marie before using.","durationMinutes":null}],"nutrition":null,"gaps":["Research extraction only; no culinary/editorial review.","Ingredient quantities, units, alternatives, food identities, aggregate duration, and nutrition remain unknown until individually parsed/reviewed.","Source-level CC BY-SA policy applies generally; page-specific exceptions have not been checked."]}},"parsedRecipe":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"wikibooks:38390","recordId":"wikibooks-38390-r4610550","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceRevision":"4610550","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Neapolitan%20Sauce&oldid=4610550","sourceSha256":"a6e2cb359b7485f6972e84b9ffb1cc9001d224206db56ce65dd295676766fd0e","parserVersion":"wikibooks-sections-v3","quantityParserVersion":"source-prefix-v2","license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wik